  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──など、２８３プロでは、\r\n本人の資質や希望に合わせた活動を……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "資質や希望？　本当に？\r\nやりたくない仕事を無理やりさせたりとかは？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チャレンジしてみようと持ちかけることはあります\r\nでも無理やりなんてことは絶対にありませんよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それなら安心ですね\r\n事務所に鍵でもかけられたら逃げられませんし",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……なんだか尋問でもされているみたいだな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ありがとうございました、もう結構です\r\n最後にあなたの名刺を頂きたいのですが",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……そうですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "改めまして……\r\n２８３プロダクションでプロデューサーを務めております──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あなたが…………",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うちでアイドルになりたいと思ってくれるなら、\r\nぜひまた連絡を──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ああ、アイドル志望というのは嘘です",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "私の幼馴染がそちらに所属することになりまして\r\n騙されてないか、確かめに来たんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そういうことでしたか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "悪どい芸能事務所もたくさんあるようですから？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですよね……\r\nご心配おかけして申し訳ありません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "認めてもらえるように、\r\nプロデューサーとして全力で頑張りたいと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大事なお友達が望む空に羽ばたけるように──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010150,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "すばらしいモットーですね\r\n口だけなら、なんとでも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0455",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010160,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "そろそろ失礼します\r\n今後、何かあったらすぐに連絡しますから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010170,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "名刺の電話番号に",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010170"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0243",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ……待って\r\nアイドル志望でないのなら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今、ここでスカウトさせてください……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010180,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……は……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出会った時にすぐわかりました\r\n……ダイヤの原石だって……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010190,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "は……？　ふざけないでください\r\n近寄らないで",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ぜひ、浅倉さんと一緒に！\r\nどうでしょうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010200,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010210,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……わかりました\r\nそういうことであれば",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100002/1021001010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……！\r\nええと、名前は……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001010220,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……樋口円香です\r\nよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
